    "updated_at": "2017-01-04T11:51:06Z",
    "body": "All right, I did several tests; there's no way around it. I mean, zopflipng with or without `--lossy_transparent` results to the same. Also, using pngout results to the same.\r\n\r\nThe only safe way so far is to just use `optipng -o7`, but that isn't the optimal compression. The difference is more than +30%.\r\n\r\n```\r\nOriginal:        1,29 MB (1.356.476 bytes)\r\noptipng only:    1,09 MB (1.146.417 bytes)   210059\r\nall compressors: 973 KB    (997.312 bytes)   359164\r\n```",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/html/issues/comments/270354058/reactions",
